Project modification notice — 2026-08-31
-----------------------------------------

This project does not redistribute Overture Places records unchanged. It makes
the following changes when producing facility results:

* filters records by confidence and supported visitor-facility category;
* drops records without a usable name or category;
* deduplicates Overture records against OpenStreetMap facilities;
* clips the result to the selected displayed boundary; and
* rounds retained coordinates to six decimal places.

The resulting subset is merged with OpenStreetMap-derived facilities. Generated
artifacts and API results record their own generation time where that metadata
is available.

